a) What is the difference between a constructor and an ordinary method (6 marks)

b) Study the code below and answer questions below it

 double p = 1.0;

 int n = 18;

 for (int i=1; i<=n; i++) {

 if (n%2 == 1) p = p * 2;

 System.out.println( p);

 }

 i. What is the output of the program (3 marks)

 ii. Rewrite the above code using a while…statement (5 marks)

 iii. Draw a flow diagram to represent these structure (6 marks)

